Package: lookout
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), rpicam-apps-core, ffmpeg
Recommends: libturbojpeg0, pipewire-pulse
Section: APPLaunch
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bfeller/lookout
Description: Watch and listen through the Cardputer Zero's camera from your phone
 Scan the QR code on the Cardputer and your phone's browser shows the live
 camera, with optional sound from the microphone. Use it as a portable
 security camera or an inspection camera for hard-to-see places. No app or
 account needed; video and audio stay on your local Wi-Fi network.
